      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>deletePolicy</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>deletePolicy defines the policy used to identify nodes to delete when downscaling. Defaults to "Random".  Valid values are "Random, "Newest", "Oldest"</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>minReadySeconds</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>minReadySeconds is the minimum number of seconds for which a newly created machine should be ready. Defaults to 0 (machine will be considered available as soon as it is ready)</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>replicas</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>replicas is the number of desired replicas. This is a pointer to distinguish between explicit zero and unspecified. Defaults to 1.</TableCell>
