      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>selector is a label query over machines that should match the replica count. Label keys and values that must match in order to be controlled by this MachineSet. It must match the machine template’s labels. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/labels/#label-selectors</p></dd>
